        "tabcustom_RiQNtC": {
          "type": "tabcustom",
          "settings": {
            "title_tab": "Product information",
            "icon": "checkmark",
            "answer_content": "<p>Ancient wisdom meets modern science. BellyOrb's revolutionary ball-shaped 'orb' delivers 18 powerful Chinese herbs through your belly button, nature's direct pathway to wellness. This unique delivery system transforms your wellness journey while you rest, offering superior absorption compared to conventional supplements. Our carefully curated blend of traditional herbs, including Longan, Wormwood, Astragalus, Cinnamon, Clove, Ginger, and White Peony Root, works holistically to support healthy metabolism, control hunger, maintains balanced blood sugar levels, and promote optimal gut health.<br/><br/>Free from gluten, soy, dairy, and artificial additives, BellyOrb offers a clean, effective approach to whole-body wellness. Unlike oral supplements that typically offer only 10% absorption and may cause digestive discomfort, BellyOrb's unique topical delivery system allows for up to 90% bioavailability of active ingredients.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tabcustom_amYFTj": {
          "type": "tabcustom",
          "settings": {
            "title_tab": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "shield",
            "answer_content": "<p>Wormwood, Sichuan Pepper, Longan, Ginger, White Peony Root, Licorice, Clove, Pepper Seeds, Cinnamon, Astragalus, Cyperus Rotundus, Atractylodes Macrocephala, Tangerine Peel, Cardamom, Evodia Fruit, Yizherin, Chuanxiong, Corydalis, Honey</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "0a71f30d-dba2-4bca-a64d-c3cc2ed17e7d": {
          "type": "tabcustom",
          "settings": {
            "title_tab": "How To Use",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "answer_content": "<p>Remove the ‘orb from protective paper. Place 'orb' on your navel and secure with the adhesive patch for up to 8 hours of continuous botanical support. Alternatively, you may place the orb to the Yong Quan acupoint located on the sole of your feet.</p>",
