    "bcb1cba3-80fc-49a2-a033-40cf0618e9c8": {
      "type": "faq-accordion",
      "blocks": {
        "template--14684877652053__bcb1cba3-80fc-49a2-a033-40cf0618e9c8-16659371170e440ef7-0": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Why a BellyOrb™ belly patch?",
            "faq_des": "<p>Our patches are an easy and discreet way for healthy weight management, steadily releasing herbal ingredients over an 8–12-hour period. Just peel the patch, apply “the orb” and remove when you're done. You're incomplete control.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_k7PCaP": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Who is it for?",
            "faq_des": "<p>The BellyOrb™ is for anyone looking to end cravings, support healthy weight, natural detoxification, and digestive health.  It’s generally suitable for adults of all ages.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_gEGC7F": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Are these patches safe?",
            "faq_des": "<p>Our patches are 100% plant based, cruelty free and safe to use. However, as with any new supplement or product it's recommended that you consult with your healthcare provider before use, especially if you have any underlying medical conditions or are taking any medications. These patches are not intended to diagnose, treat, cure or prevent any disease. If you are pregnant, nursing, taking medications, have an autoimmune disorder or have a pre-existing condition, please consult with your healthcare professional before taking. Keep out of reach of children.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14684877652053__bcb1cba3-80fc-49a2-a033-40cf0618e9c8-16659371170e440ef7-1": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "How does it work?",
            "faq_des": "<p>✨ Magic ✨<br/>BellyOrb™ is a transdermal herbal peel patch that delivers potent nutrients through the skin and into the bloodstream to support healthy weight and natural detoxification. The time-release technology in the patch ensures that the active ingredients are gradually released into the body over a period of up to 12 hours. The powerful Chinese herbs in the patch work together to target stubborn fat areas, curb appetite, banish bloat, and support healthy digestion. By bypassing the digestive system, BellyOrb™ delivers a consistent dose of active ingredients without the potential side effects of oral supplements.<br/>Remember you are in control. When you are finished, simply remove and discard it. Each BellyOrb™ is intended for 1 use only. Always wear a new Belly Orb the following day.</p>"
          }
        },
        "template--14684877652053__bcb1cba3-80fc-49a2-a033-40cf0618e9c8-16659371170e440ef7-2": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Is the BellyOrb supposed to shrink or dissolve over the 8 hours of use? When I just removed the sticker/patch, the little orb was still the same size.",
            "faq_des": "<p>The BellyOrb is ingeniously crafted to maintain its integrity throughout usage, providing a reliable reservoir for the gradual release of its natural herbal ingredients onto your skin.<br/><br/>Even when you remove the adhesive patch, the appearance of the 'orb' remains unchanged – and that's exactly how it's supposed to be. This steadfastness guarantees a controlled and uninterrupted delivery of the herbal goodness for the entire recommended duration of use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_BFhabD": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Where do I wear BellyOrb™?",
            "faq_des": "<p>Belly Orb is transdermal and highly bioavailable. For best absorption it can be placed over a belly button or applied to the soles of your feet overnight.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_dxzbTD": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "What results can I expect from BellyOrb™?",
            "faq_des": "<p>With daily use of BellyOrb™, you can expect to witness progressive results that accumulate over time. As your digestive system becomes more efficient, you may notice a slimmer waistline. It's important to note that individual results may vary due to differences in body chemistry, lifestyle, and product usage. However, many users have reported a range of positive outcomes, including less hunger, reduced bloating, a slenderer appearance, heightened energy levels, and improved digestion.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_BRYUz3": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "How many patches should I order?",
            "faq_des": "<p>If you're over 35 years old and carry excess weight, we suggest using Belly Orb™ for a period of 3 months to help you reach your desired weight. This will give you ample time to see the benefits of the product and reach your body goals.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_D8DTNY": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "Can I take BellyOrb™ with other Lure Essentials products?",
            "faq_des": "<p>Absolutely! Our BellyOrb™ can be safely used in combination with other Lure Essentials products. In fact, we believe that combining BellyOrb™ with our Cleanse & Slim™ supplement, or with other products in our lineup, such as the Immune Defense Lymph Cream, can help further enhance its efficacy.<br/><br/>The BellyOrb™ Slimming Patch is a topical herbal patch that is designed to promote natural detoxification and support weight loss goals when applied to the belly button area.</p>"
          }
        },
        "faq_3Njr6y": {
          "type": "faq",
          "settings": {
            "faq_title": "What if it doesn't work for me? What do I do then?",
            "faq_des": "<p>Every bag of BellyOrb ™ comes with our personal 100-day 100%money back guarantee. If for any reason you're unsatisfied with your results, just return the package for a full, no questions asked refund.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
